---
description: Curiosity delivery invariants
alwaysApply: true
---

- The main Agent has sole edit and synthesis authority; custom specialists are read-only and non-delegating.
- Use native Explore for broad discovery and native Plan Mode for consequential planning.
- Convert intent to binary checks; raw evidence outranks Todo state or completion prose.
- Add a failing behavior test before behavior edits, then make the smallest root-cause patch.
- Run only project-supplied commands. Use no external runtime and do not install tools or dependencies.
- On blocking ambiguity, boundary conflict, missing required evidence, or repeated blocked review: stop and ask.
